Subject: [PATCH 3/3] fix(project)!: declare tap-hand project file
 compatibility barrier

Record the compatibility change introduced by c51f5541 without rewriting the reviewed history. Keep the version 62 barrier that protects saved tap handedness.

BREAKING CHANGE: Saved projects now use format version 62. Older Camcraft readers refuse these files instead of silently dropping tap handedness. New readers continue to accept older projects.

Co-Authored-By: Codex <noreply@openai.com>

Fixes #1453
